# ROVEXO INBOX HUB MASTER IMPLEMENTATION v1.0

**STATUS: PERMANENTLY LOCKED**

Not a redesign. Inbox Hub is the **only** official Transaction Hub.

```
ONE FEATURE = ONE ENTRY POINT (/inbox) = ONE IMPLEMENTATION
```

